# A worked example of companies working together (2026-09-30): the hammer waits until a
# neighbour has the enemy engaged, then goes in with the bayonet. Pair it with Anvil.
drill "Hammer"
about "Waits short of the fight until a neighbour has the enemy engaged, then goes in with the bayonet. Meets a charge with a charge and runs down a breaking enemy."
type Grenadier
dials aggression 0.85 discipline 0.60 cohesion 0.60 cover 0.40 patience 0.30 nerve 0.85

sergeant:
  when enemy breaking or enemy broken              -> charge
  when enemy charging and enemy within 30          -> charge
  when neighbour engaged and enemy within 50       -> charge; form open
  when neighbour falling back and enemy within 40  -> charge
  when enemy within 50                             -> hold; find cover; hold fire
  when time over 120s                              -> charge
  otherwise                                        -> advance slow; form open; hold fire

man:
  when enemy within 12                             -> charge
  when charging                                    -> charge
  otherwise                                        -> follow sergeant
